# The basics-batch synthesis (2026-08-01). One night, one seed, one knob
# per arm, and three knobs measurably moved: cover (survival 3,215 and
# rival dip 9,100 -- both records, from two turrets and the compounding
# they bought), the pinned 900 reserve (freed the economy for the previous
# best dip, 3,900), and the 1,400-credit artillery mech through ordinary
# production (six fielded, longest prior survival at 3,190). Refuted and
# left out: fabricators, scout tax, funded 4,500 bunkers
# ([[community-play-strategies]]).

